stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> idle_example : open model page
  idle_example --> advanced : More
  advanced --> idle_example : Less
  idle_example --> confirm_example : Run (unedited sample)
  confirm_example --> idle_example : Edit my input
  confirm_example --> starting : Run anyway
  starting --> error_no_credits : 403 exhausted balance (observed)
  starting --> in_queue : documented IN_QUEUE(position)
  in_queue --> in_progress : documented IN_PROGRESS(logs)
  in_progress --> completed : documented COMPLETED
  in_queue --> cancelled : cancel (documented, immediate)
  in_progress --> cancelled : cancel (documented, best-effort)
  completed --> share_result : Share / Examples card
  share_result --> next_model : Edit / Upscale / Make Video (?fromOutput)
  error_no_credits --> credits_popover : Add credits
